description "Redeemed Selkath

Multi-life creatures prone to mania. Combat-proficient both on land and in the sea.

^2Weaponry:
- Toxic Claws (Heavy Melee)
-- Poisons on hit
-- 5% faster RoF
-- 15% more Move Spd
- Double Vibroswords (Dual)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- 30% shorter
- Sonic Pistol
- Sonic Rifle
- Dual Blaster Pistols
- Stun Baton (3)

^6Inventory:
- Medpac

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- 10% faster Skill Cd
- Enviro Protect (1)
- Getup (4)
- Strength (1)
- Fury (1)
- Assemble (1)
- Underwater Breathing

^3Abilities:
- Shoulder Barge ^3[CS2]
- Dash (1) ^3[CS3]"